// The ONE place the iOS bundle identifier is set. Everything else derives from it:
//   app            $(APP_BUNDLE_ID)
//   widgets / LA   $(APP_BUNDLE_ID).widgets
//   App Group      group.$(APP_BUNDLE_ID)
// If you change it, also change BUNDLE_ID in codemagic.yaml and
// AppConfig.bundleId in lib/app_config.dart (tool/check_bundle_id.sh verifies all three).
APP_BUNDLE_ID = com.exeapp.exe
